OL,3,GNEWSA'Making people laugh has given us
OL,4,Aa purpose'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Wolverhampton mother and her
OL,7,F11-year-old daughter have become
OL,8,Finternet sensations after amassing
OL,9,Fmillions of views across Instagram and
OL,10,FTikTok with videos of their morning
OL,11,Froutines, dances and song parodies.
OL,13,F"We turned [our] pain into purpose
OL,14,Fbecause, behind everything, there's
OL,15,Fbeen a lot of struggle," said Amn, who
OL,16,Ftogether with daughter, Ria, have been
OL,17,Fmaking social media videos to bring a
OL,18,Fsmile to their community.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
