OL,3,GNEWSA'Making people laugh has given us
OL,4,Aa purpose'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe duo started making content as a way
OL,7,Fof helping their family cope with the
OL,8,Fsudden death of Amn's father in 2023,
OL,9,Fand also to provide a platform to help
OL,10,Fbreak down stigmas within the South
OL,11,FAsian community.
OL,13,F"It [also] comes from a place of a lot
OL,14,Fof pain, being a young mum, giving
OL,15,Fbirth to a daughter when the
OL,16,Fexpectations around you were those of a
OL,17,Fson," Amn told BBC Radio WM.
